  data: {
    LLM: 'Deal all 108 cards, 27 to each player. The starting player leads any legal combination; other players may pass or play a higher combination of the same type, while bombs and special high combinations can overcall. When three players pass, the last player to play wins control and leads next. A hand ends as players empty their hands, and the finishing order determines team level advancement.',
    Player: 'Deal all 108 cards, 27 to each player. The starting player leads any legal combination; other players may pass or play a higher combination of the same type, while bombs and special high combinations can overcall. When three players pass, the last player to play wins control and leads next. A hand ends as players empty their hands, and the finishing order determines team level advancement.',
    objective: 'Advance through all levels (2 to Ace) and win a hand at Level Ace with the correct finishing order (1st & 2nd, or 1st & 3rd).',
